<v Jenny Slate>But what I want to talk more about is how good one of my presents was one time. I think that I'll never die because of the energy that I got from that one day of getting the present. It gave me an extra heart somewhere in my body. That's how exciting it was. OK. It was from my grandparents, who were a wild card, a lot of mock turtlenecks in the mix for sure.
<v Jenny Slate>但我更想谈谈有一次我的一个礼物有多好。我想我永远不会死，因为我从那天得到礼物中获得的能量。它在我的身体某处给了我一颗额外的心脏。它就是这么令人兴奋。好的。它来自我的祖父母，他们是通配符，肯定有很多高领毛衣在里面。

