00:55:09.130 --> 00:55:33.590
<v Dave Hill>It was Christmas Eve, and all our friends and family came over to the house. And yes, Karen, I know it wasn't my house. I don't own a house, Karen. And I guess that makes me not a real person or something, right? Anyway, so the doorbell rings, and guess who it is? It's Karen, everybody's favorite. Only it's not just you at the door. There's some guy with you, too. Some guy in a dumb sweater.
<v Dave Hill>那是圣诞前夜，我们所有的朋友和家人都来到家里。是的，凯伦，我知道那不是我的房子。我不拥有房子，凯伦。我想这使我不是一个真正的人或者其他什么，对吧？不管怎样，门铃响了，猜猜是谁？是凯伦，大家的最爱。只是不仅是你站在门口。还有个家伙和你在一起。某个穿着愚蠢毛衣的家伙。

00:55:33.590 --> 00:55:56.400
<v Dave Hill>And you walk in and you're all like, Merry Christmas, everybody. I'd like everyone to meet my boyfriend, Don. And naturally, I can't help but think to myself, well that's strange. I thought I was Karen's boyfriend. Who the hell is Don? And so I just decided to go ahead and say it out loud. I said, well that's strange. I thought I was Karen's boyfriend. Who the hell is Don?
<v Dave Hill>你走进来，你们都像，圣诞快乐，大家。我想让大家认识一下我的男朋友，唐（Don）。自然地，我忍不住心想，嗯那很奇怪。我以为我是凯伦的男朋友。唐是谁？所以我决定直接说出来。我说，嗯那很奇怪。我以为我是凯伦的男朋友。唐是谁？

